      "overall_description": "BayCare Ballpark serves as a premier minor-league baseball venue in Clearwater, Florida, hosting the Clearwater Threshers and Philadelphia Phillies spring training. It is widely praised for its friendly staff, excellent seating with great field visibility, and a family-friendly atmosphere that makes it a top destination for sports fans. With convenient amenities, diverse food choices, and regular events like fireworks and community festivals, the park provides a high-quality, accessible experience for visitors of all ages.",
