      "ambience_description": "The ballpark offers a warm, family-friendly atmosphere where visitors can enjoy quality baseball and entertainment in a clean and comfortable setting.",
      "amenities_description": "The facility features a range of amenities including diverse food and beverage options, a large team store, accessible seating, and family-oriented areas like playgrounds and sunscreen stations.",
