      "short_description": "5,509-seat stadium hosting Toronto Blue Jays spring training and Class-A Dunedin Blue Jays, with renovated seating, concessions, bars, and kids' activity areas.",
      "number_of_stations": null,
      "cuisine_description": null,
      "overall_description": "TD Ballpark is a premier, renovated baseball facility located in downtown Dunedin, Florida, serving as the spring training home for the Toronto Blue Jays and the regular venue for the Dunedin Blue Jays. Known for its intimate layout, the stadium ensures every fan has an excellent view of the field while enjoying a wide selection of concessions, bars, and kid-friendly entertainment zones. The venue is highly regarded for its clean, safe, and family-oriented environment, making it a beloved destination for local residents and visiting tourists alike. Whether attending a high-stakes spring training game or a relaxed minor league event, guests can count on a memorable experience defined by great energy and professional service.",
      "service_description": null,
      "ambience_description": "The atmosphere is energetic and social, providing a classic, fun-filled environment perfect for enjoying baseball. It is characterized by friendly staff, clean facilities, and a community-oriented spirit.",
      "amenities_description": "The stadium offers a variety of amenities including multiple concession stands, on-site bars, and dedicated play areas for children. Guests also have access to a team merchandise shop and well-maintained public restrooms.",
      "unique_selling_points": "As the official home of Toronto Blue Jays spring training, this stadium is uniquely positioned to offer an intimate, high-quality baseball viewing experience where every seat provides an excellent vantage point.",
      "neighborhood_description": "The ballpark is situated in a walkable and friendly area, making it easy for visitors to access local downtown shops and dining. It is surrounded by a safe community that contributes to a relaxed and welcoming game-day vibe.",
      "physical_setting_description": "Located in the heart of Dunedin, this renovated 5,509-seat baseball stadium serves as the primary home for spring training and minor league games. The facility features a clean, well-maintained concourse with a mix of open and covered seating areas.",
      "customer_demographics_description": null,
